INSERT INTO part (id, message_id, session_id, time_created, time_updated, data) VALUES ('prt_0060', 'msg_0015', 'opencode-real-sanitized', 1786708855834, 1786708855834, '{"text":"Now I have a good picture of all three formats: 1. **Codex**: JSONL rollout. Event types: `session_meta`, `turn_context`, `event_msg`, `response_item`. `response_item` payload types: `message` (role), `function_call` (name + arguments JSON string, call_id), `function_call_output` (call_id + output string), `reasoning`. Order matters (the JSONL is chronological). 2. **Pi Agent**: JSONL session. Types: `session`, `model_change`, `thinking_level_change`, `message`. Message content items: `text`, `thinking`, `toolCall` (need to check toolCall structure). Let me quickly check the toolCall structure. 3. **OpenCode**: SQLite. `session`/`message`/`part`. Part types: `text`, `tool`, `reasoning`, `step-start`, `step-finish`. Let me check Pi toolCall structure quickly, and OpenCode tool part structure.","time":{"end":1786708857680,"start":1786708855833},"type":"reasoning"}');
