on_path: &Path) -> Result<Trace, String>; fn list_sessions(&self) -> Result<Vec<String>, String>; } ``` Actually let me design readers with a function per agent. The `Reader` trait can b\n[TRUNCATED]","time":{"end":1786709977254,"start":1786709965840},"type":"reasoning"}');
