INSERT INTO part (id, message_id, session_id, time_created, time_updated, data) VALUES ('prt_0168', 'msg_0043', 'opencode-real-sanitized', 1786710060367, 1786710060367, '{"text":"Now the export module. It writes: - `seed.json` — the IR trace (canonical). - `seed.md` — markdown transcript for human / context injection. - `manifest.json` — source fingerprint + seed files + target info (initially target empty). Manifest schema: ```json { \"version\": 1, \"seed_files\": [\"seed.json\", \"seed.md\"], \"source\": { \"agent\": \"codex\", \"session_id\": \"...\", \"file\": \"...\", \"file_sha256\": \"...\", \"events_sha256\": \"...\", \"event_count\": 123, \"exported_at\": \"iso\" }, \"target\": null // filled by import } ``` Let me write export.rs. The markdown transcript generator should include the conversation and tool calls, with reasoning optionally included. I''ll include reasoning in a collapsible blockquote. Tool calls shown as blocks. Let me write export.rs.","time":{"end":1786710062276,"start":1786710060367},"type":"reasoning"}');
