INSERT INTO part (id, message_id, session_id, time_created, time_updated, data) VALUES ('prt_0268', 'msg_0069', 'opencode-real-sanitized', 1786710229202, 1786710229202, '{"callID":"call_0081","state":{"input":{"command":"jq ''.events[:6]'' /tmp/opencode/seed-pi/seed.json | head -60; echo \"===MD head===\"; head -30 /tmp/opencode/seed-pi/seed.md"},"metadata":{"exit":0,"output":"... s Entry API、Harness Core 的显式 start path；当前不要求该路径展开 Runtime connection，也不为验证增加临时 Agent-facing 命令或伪产品功能。\\n- 第一阶段只组合 `pbw codex` 入口；其他 launcher、Runtime 和 integration 只通过已有边界保持可扩展性，不建立额外空实现。\\n- 旧 `src/**`、manifests、tests、examples、headers、构建产物和实验文件已经删除；新 workspace 不得引用或依赖 Git 历史中的旧实现。\\n- D-021-I skeleton 已创建：初始 workspace、最小 typed boundary、composition construction/report wiring、placeholder unsupported 行为和 dependency direction check 均已落到当前树中。\\n\\n#### 物理边界与依赖的考虑点\\n\\n- Cargo workspace 已确定；package/crate 边界按逻辑 ownership 划分，并评估可替换性、编译、依赖、测试/版本节奏和权限部署需求。OS process boundary 与 crate boundary 保持概念独立。\\n- Shared semantic types 由 `pbw-contract` 拥有，并严格限制为跨 Harness/Runtime boundary 的最小中立 contract，防止它变成包含 policy 或 backend detail 的公共杂物层。\\n- 初始 workspace 采用从产品/composition 向 contract/mechanism 的单向依赖，不允许 contract/local-control/API/core 反向依赖 Harness、integration、launcher、CLI 或具体 adapter。\\n- Harness 不依赖具体 Runtime 实现，transport、PID、namespace 和 privilege detail 留在 Runtime ownership boundary 内；Harness 负责选择并连接 Runtime Service，具体 transport/client/adapter 仍待收敛，不能由 `pbw-cli` 依赖注入。\\n- Execution/Workspace/Input/Effect/Outcome placeholder 位于 Runtime API/default Runtime 两层，Operation Integration 位于 Harness/command integration 两层；未来补充 backend 不应修改无关层的公共接口。\\n- Crate boundary 是编译期 ownership/dependency boundary，本身不等于 trait-object dynamic dispatch、serialization、IPC 或 OS process boundary；运行时成本取决于实际调用与数据传递机制。\\n- 扩展点不自动要求独立 crate。只有当实现需要独立替换、携带 heavyweight/platform-specific dependency、形成权限/进程边界、需要阻止反向依赖，或具有独立版本与测试节奏时，才需要评估独立 crate；否则 module + trait 也可表达替换点。\\n- 需要避免“每个概念一个 crate”造成 public API、转换胶水、feature matrix 和编译管理膨胀，也要避免单一 crate 让 Harness policy、Runtime mechanism、产品适配和 backend detail 互相可见。\\n- Shared semantic types 指确实跨 Harness/Runtime typed boundary 的中立 contract values，例如 launch/context/candidate/Proposal/outcome/commit/disposition/event 的描述与 opaque handles。它们不应包含 Harness policy、Runtime mutable state、PID/socket/namespace、transport frame 或具体 backend handle。\\n- Shared definitions 可以减少重复类型与转换漂移，但会耦合双方的发布和变化节奏；o\n[TRUNCATED]","outputPath":"/home/user/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_0003a82c8001frq94oJIQg9xcp","truncated":true},"output":"...output truncated... Full output saved to: /home/user/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_0003a82c8001frq94oJIQg9xcp \"exit_code\": null, \"error\": null }, { \"time\": 1786375293065, \"type\": \"reasoning\", \"text\": \"The Discussion.md is quite long. Let me see the beginning of the file to understand the full context, and also look at the design documents, especially `docs/design/terminology.md` which is the terminology mapping document that was mentioned as \\\"已落盘\\\" (already saved to disk).\\n\\nThe user says \\\"我们来逐个术语商量含义吧，自顶向下\\\" (Let''s discuss the meaning of terms one by one, top-down). This seems to be a continuation of a discussion about terminology. The Discussion.md mentions \\\"Harness 术语解释\\\" section:\\n\\n- 后续逐一解释并收敛 managed launch orchestration、policy context、obligation，以及真实进程、Workspace、Effect、lifecycle state machine 各自的实现范围。\\n- 用户要求先理解这些术语，再决定 pbw-harness 的具体实现边界。\\n\\nSo the user wants to go through terms one by one, top-down. Let me first look at the terminology document and the beginning of Discussion.md to understand what''s been established.\" } ] ===MD head=== # 执行轨迹 / Execution Trace - **源 agent**: `pi` - **session**: `019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f` - **工作目录**: /home/user/WORKSPACE/AgentScout - **模型**: deepseek-v4-flash - **事件数**: 332 --- > 模型切换: deepseek-v4-flash ## 用户 我们来逐个术语商量含义吧，自顶向下 > 🔒 推理过程（reasoning） > > The user wants to discuss terminology one by one, top-down, for the ASCout project. This is a discussion workflow. Let me first understand the project context - I should look at the existing design documents and Discussion.md to understand what terminology exists. > > Let me explore the project structure first. ### 🛠 工具调用 `bash` (id: call_00_RgUJNcwySJ052hhPJenv8566) ```json { \"command\": \"ls -la /home/user/WORKSPACE/AgentScout/ && echo \\\"---\\\" && ls /home/user/WORKSPACE/AgentScout/docs/ 2>/dev/null && echo \\\"---\\\" && cat /home/user/WORKSPACE/AgentScout/Discussion.md 2>/dev/null\" } ```","status":"completed","time":{"end":1786710229705,"start":1786710229701},"title":"jq ''.events[:6]'' /tmp/opencode/seed-pi/seed.json | head -60; echo \"===MD head===\"; head -30 /tmp/opencode/seed-pi/seed.md"},"tool":"bash","type":"tool"}');
