INSERT INTO part (id, message_id, session_id, time_created, time_updated, data) VALUES ('prt_0384', 'msg_0100', 'opencode-real-sanitized', 1786710373884, 1786710373884, '{"text":"Clean. Now let me write integration tests with fixtures. I''ll create `tests/fixtures/` with a codex JSONL, a pi JSONL, and build tests that: 1. Read codex fixture → assert event counts/types. 2. Read pi fixture → assert event counts/types. 3. OpenCode reader: create a temp sqlite DB by importing a trace, then re-read → assert counts match. 4. Round-trip: import pi fixture → re-read → compare event counts. 5. Export writes seed.json/seed.md/manifest.json. Let me create fixture files. For codex, a small fixture: ```jsonl {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"type\":\"session_meta\",\"payload\":{\"id\":\"sess-1\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"cwd\":\"/tmp/work\",\"model_provider\":\"openai\"}} {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:01.000Z\",\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"id\":\"a\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"input_text\",\"text\":\"hello\"}]}} {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:02.000Z\",\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"id\":\"b\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"text\":\"hi there\"}]}} {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:03.000Z\",\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"id\":\"c\",\"type\":\"function_call\",\"call_id\":\"call_1\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"cmd\\\":\\\"ls\\\"}\"}} {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:04.000Z\",\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"id\":\"d\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_1\",\"output\":\"file1\\nfile2\\n\"}} {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:05.000Z\",\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"id\":\"e\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"thinking about it\"}]}} ``` For pi fixture: ```jsonl {\"type\":\"session\",\"version\":3,\"id\":\"pi-sess-1\",\"timestamp\":\