moke/pi-to-open/pi/019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f source events_sha256: c701d9f2e48d750acaec582858ca9dc052d368d80c391ec29217b77898399144 injected into opencode as session ses_bf0080414da4478493fd860f9d9eaabb (174 messages) target file: /tmp/migrate-real-smoke/opencode-db/opencode.db anchor message id: msg_11bc569065464070a943e70998b00abd dropped target-native events: 1 (seed.json still keeps the full trace) manifest updated: /tmp/migrate-real-smoke/pi-to-open/pi/019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f/manifest.json SOURCE source file: /home/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--home-user-WORKSPACE-AgentScout--/2026-08-10T15-20-56-187Z_019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f.jsonl file hash unchanged: yes events unchanged: yes TARGET target is at the seed point (no new messages) session present: yes anchor present: yes continued past seed: NO === real pi -> pi temp root === read pi: session=019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f events=332 (source sha256 ee6f8cdae338…) exported to /tmp/migrate-real-smoke/pi-to-pi/pi/019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f source events_sha256: c701d9f2e48d750acaec582858ca9dc052d368d80c391ec29217b77898399144 injected into pi as session 7c7d58bc-9a7f-4cd0-9639-2a70a48a7e0a (332 messages) target file: /tmp/migrate-real-smoke/pi-root/--home-user-WORKSPACE-AgentScout--/2026-08-15T00-32-37.152Z_7c7d58bc-9a7f-4cd0-9639-2a70a48a7e0a.jsonl anchor message id: d91e91f7 manifest updated: /tmp/migrate-real-smoke/pi-to-pi/pi/019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f/manifest.json SOURCE source file: /home/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--home-user-WORKSPACE-AgentScout--/2026-08-10T15-20-56-187Z_019fec43-387b-76ca-8633-e4cf4caed99f.jsonl file hash unchanged: yes events unchanged: yes TARGET target pi session is at the seed point (event hash matches) session present: yes anchor present: yes continued past seed: NO === rea\n[TRUNCATED]","status":"completed","time":{"end":1786753957662,"start":1786753957658},"title":"set -e PI_SESS=2026-08-10T15-20-56-187Z_019fec43-387b-76ca-8633